      "reason": "The fields should be compared on their native grids and regridded only for the requested display maps, because regridding changes the land-sea mask and is not conservative.",
      "status": "condensed",
      "notes": [
        "Regrid only for the maps and the cell-by-cell comparison ('conservative' going to a coarser grid; state the method); take means, area percentages and correlations' sample on each model's own grid with its own cell areas.",
